---
.title = "About",
.layout = "index.shtml",
---
Second page, linked from the index via `$site.page('about').absLink()` to
prove the shared `linkImpl` composes correctly for a page OTHER than
`$page` itself, not just the one currently rendering.

# [Intro]($heading.id('intro'))

Every page in this fixture carries this same anchor, so the shared
`index.shtml` layout's `linkRef('intro')`/`absLinkRef('intro')` calls
(evaluated against whichever page is `$page` for that render) resolve on
both pages.
